The Modem tile, over t715-modem-power

The modem's own switch, next to Airplane mode: off powers the SS333's CP down and
keeps it off across a reboot, on boots it again (t715-modem-power, package
t715-modem, through polkit; docs/hardware/MODEM.md §5.4). A long press opens
Réseau mobile, which also holds the modem's standby setting. The Mobile data tile
says "Modem off" rather than "Set up" while the switch is off. Against
omarchy-mobile 87b8395 (omamobile-shell 0.2.94) and the patches before it,
packages/omamobile-shell.

